WEBVTT

00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:19.626
Follow the spiders.
Follow the spiders!

00:00:19.626 --> 00:00:21.672
If Hagrid ever gets
out of Azkaban,

00:00:21.672 --> 00:00:22.716
I'll kill him!

00:00:38.210 --> 00:00:41.430
I mean, what was the point
of sending us in there?

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:43.737
What have we found out?

00:00:43.737 --> 00:00:46.392
We know one thing.

00:00:46.392 --> 00:00:50.048
Hagrid never opened
the Chamber of Secrets.

00:00:50.048 --> 00:00:52.006
He was innocent.

00:01:07.413 --> 00:01:09.458
Wish you were here, Hermione.

00:01:09.458 --> 00:01:11.199
We need you.

00:01:13.419 --> 00:01:15.421
Now more than ever.

00:01:32.264 --> 00:01:33.787
What's that?

00:01:33.787 --> 00:01:38.749
Ron, this is why Hermione
was in the library

00:01:38.749 --> 00:01:41.403
the day she was attacked.

00:01:41.403 --> 00:01:43.188
Come on!

00:01:43.188 --> 00:01:47.235
"Of the many fearsome beasts
that roam our land,

00:01:47.235 --> 00:01:49.629
"none is more deadly
than the basilisk.

00:01:49.629 --> 00:01:51.849
"Capable of living
for hundreds of years,

00:01:51.849 --> 00:01:53.415
"instant death awaits any

00:01:53.415 --> 00:01:55.548
"who meet
this giant serpent's eye.

00:01:55.548 --> 00:01:57.419
Spiders flee before it..."

00:01:57.419 --> 00:01:59.160
Ron, this is it.

00:01:59.160 --> 00:02:01.815
The monster in the Chamber
of Secrets is a basilisk.

00:02:01.815 --> 00:02:04.078
That's why I can hear it speak.
It's a snake.

00:02:05.645 --> 00:02:08.474
But if it kills
by looking people in the eye,

00:02:08.474 --> 00:02:11.477
why is it
no one's dead?

00:02:21.139 --> 00:02:23.924
Because no one
did look it in the eye.

00:02:26.318 --> 00:02:28.624
Not directly, at least.

00:02:31.149 --> 00:02:32.628
Colin saw it
through his camera.

00:02:32.628 --> 00:02:34.152
Justin...

00:02:34.152 --> 00:02:35.675
Justin must have
seen the basilisk

00:02:35.675 --> 00:02:37.155
through Nearly
Headless Nick.

00:02:37.155 --> 00:02:38.678
Nick got the full
blast of it,

00:02:38.678 --> 00:02:41.420
but he's a ghost.
He couldn't die again.

00:02:41.420 --> 00:02:43.509
And Hermione...

00:02:43.509 --> 00:02:44.858
had the mirror.

00:02:44.858 --> 00:02:46.338
I bet you anything
she was using it

00:02:46.338 --> 00:02:47.992
to look around corners
in case it came along.

00:02:47.992 --> 00:02:49.080
And Mrs. Norris?

00:02:49.080 --> 00:02:50.995
I'm pretty sure
she didn't have

00:02:50.995 --> 00:02:52.736
a camera
or a mirror, Harry.

00:02:54.781 --> 00:02:57.131
The water...

00:02:57.131 --> 00:02:59.177
There was water on the floor
that night.

00:02:59.177 --> 00:03:01.527
She only saw
the basilisk's reflection.

